@title Cabinet: the Arrange card, previews with their notes, Cancel stores nothing, Accept is one undo step
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Where it lives: the Arrange entry of the Cabinet left rail (second tool), Ctrl K, and the right-click
# menu of the plate. Plan: qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooler-layout.novo (22 devices, all on rails).
# Pictures: the card, the right-click menu, Ctrl K "autoplace", the Autogroup and close-up previews
# (banner with "planning aid" wording), cancel, accept, undo back to the first state, and the notes a
# tool gives when there is nothing to do (Auto rails: every device is on a rail already).
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooler-layout.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot before
click 24 101
wait 6
expect "Autoplace on rail"
expect "Auto ducts"
shot arrange-card
key Escape
wait 4
click 880 470 right
wait 6
expect "Autoplace on rail"
expect "Close up gaps"
shot plate-menu
key Escape
wait 4
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text autoplace
wait 4
shot palette-autoplace
key Enter
wait 8
shot autoplace-result
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text autogroup
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Preview (Autogroup)"
expect "not a clearance check or a heat calculation"
expect_not "heat-aware"
shot group-preview
key Escape
wait 5
shot group-cancelled
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text close up gaps
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Preview (Autodistance"
shot tight-preview
key Enter
wait 10
shot tight-accepted
check_layout
key ctrl+z
wait 10
shot tight-undone
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text auto rails
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
shot rails-nothing-to-do
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text auto ducts
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
shot ducts-result
